; docs/22 slow_heavy frame (slice S0; sl-0207 x1.509 re-composition):
; 1.132 volleys/s (cadence 53), a short 3-blade arc — arc owns clumps
; (block-3 pattern matrix: one target eats one blade at the full tier
; value; a clump eats three). Per-shot damage 11 documents T1; the
; CLASS LANE reads the balance_frame.json tier table
; (11/16/22/31/44), not this field — the stat-frame test pins the two
; equal at T1. Speed/reach/radius are handling flavor [P]: reach ~2.9
; tiles = the short/awkward that earns the +10%-ish budget.

